fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analyticsoverlay/objectdetectionoverlay.html#objectdetectionoverlay:expire-overlay","fragment":"\n\texpire-overlay\n\nRe-uses the last overlay for the specified amount of time before\nexpiring it (in ns), NONE for never\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t1000000000\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});